{
  "declaredLength": 6420,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Increíble... ¿Cómo puede ser tan fuerte\na pesar de su personalidad?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E00630072006500ED0062006C0065002E002E002E002000BF004300F3006D006F0020007000750065006400650020007300650072002000740061006E0020006600750065007200740065000A006100200070006500730061007200200064006500200073007500200070006500720073006F006E0061006C0069006400610064003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por muy mala que sea la compatibilidad entre\ntipos, esto no me lo creo. No gano ni una...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y encima es una celebridad! ¡Si las zonas\nLilette no son más que un invento!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Delphi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440065006C007000680069002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué andas diciendo de mi \"personalidad\"? ¿Y\nqué es eso de un \"invento\"? ¿A qué te refieres?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "E-Esteee... ¿Eso le pareció haber oído?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045002D004500730074006500650065002E002E002E002000BF00450073006F0020006C0065002000700061007200650063006900F30020006800610062006500720020006F00ED0064006F003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Uy, parece que el Holomisor no funciona bien!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100550079002C0020007000610072006500630065002000710075006500200065006C00200048006F006C006F006D00690073006F00720020006E006F002000660075006E00630069006F006E00610020006200690065006E002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Decía que es usted muy refinada y que sus\nzonas Lilette son sublimes...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHablaba sola, no me haga caso.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entiendo, tal vez haya un problema con el\nHolomisor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E007400690065006E0064006F002C002000740061006C002000760065007A0020006800610079006100200075006E002000700072006F0062006C0065006D006100200063006F006E00200065006C000A0048006F006C006F006D00690073006F0072002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero pasa algo curioso. Sin él también me pareció\nhaber oído algo como \"personalidad\" e \"invento\".<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Aaah! ¡N-no es más que un pequeño\npensamiento reprimido que se me escapó!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero no es nada. ¡Seguro que se me pasa con\nun combate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F0020006E006F0020006500730020006E006100640061002E002000A100530065006700750072006F00200071007500650020007300650020006D00650020007000610073006100200063006F006E000A0075006E00200063006F006D0062006100740065002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me temo que hay que aclarar las cosas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002000740065006D006F002000710075006500200068006100790020007100750065002000610063006C00610072006100720020006C0061007300200063006F007300610073002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Y para ello decidí unir fuerzas con\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD06000000590020007000610072006100200065006C006C006F00200064006500630069006400ED00200075006E0069007200200066007500650072007A0061007300200063006F006E000A0010000201000000002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Te parece bien, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0054006500200070006100720065006300650020006200690065006E002C00200010000201000000003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por supuesto!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006F007200200073007500700075006500730074006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Piensa que podrás luchar conmigo y contra mí\nen simultáneo! ¡Qué más se puede pedir!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Solo una celebridad de mi nivel podría ser tu\nrival y tu compañera al mismo tiempo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>¿<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, quieres combatir contra mi\nversión<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nholográfica?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD06000000BF0010000201000000002C0020007100750069006500720065007300200063006F006D0062006100740069007200200063006F006E0074007200610020006D0069000A0076006500720073006900F3006E00100001BE00000A0068006F006C006F0067007200E10066006900630061003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si combatimos, puede que mademoiselle Lilette\nse olvide de lo que dije.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡De acuerdo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004400650020006100630075006500720064006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, là, là! ¡Qué atrevimiento hacerme esperar!\nEspero que aceptes cuanto antes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me acompaña Delphi, así que no te quepa\nduda alguna de que obtendremos la victoria.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ayúdame y acepta el combate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007900FA00640061006D006500200079002000610063006500700074006100200065006C00200063006F006D0062006100740065002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Perfecto! Ahora solo tengo que concentrar mis\nataques en mademoiselle Lilette y esperar que<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nse le olvide todo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>¡Con <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> a mi lado, nadie en\nel mundo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npodrá<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ninterponerse!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 13,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD06000000A10043006F006E00200010000201000000002000610020006D00690020006C00610064006F002C0020006E006100640069006500200065006E000A0065006C0020006D0075006E0064006F00100001BE00000A0070006F0064007200E100100001BE00000A0069006E0074006500720070006F006E0065007200730065002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Todos miran y admiran a la estrella que los guía!\n¡Adelante, Clefable!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es hora de sacar a mi as bajo la manga.\n¡Megaevoluciona y dales su merecido, Dragalge!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pese a ser un holograma, yo también puedo\nusar la megaevolución! ¡Qué curioso!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡La victoria estaba más que asegurada!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C006100200076006900630074006F00720069006100200065007300740061006200610020006D00E1007300200071007500650020006100730065006700750072006100640061002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A Delphi le dan esos arrebatos porque no está\nsatisfecha con su situación.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aunque no logro entender cómo alguien\npodría ser infeliz a mi lado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410075006E0071007500650020006E006F0020006C006F00670072006F00200065006E00740065006E0064006500720020006300F3006D006F00200061006C0067007500690065006E000A0070006F0064007200ED0061002000730065007200200069006E00660065006C0069007A002000610020006D00690020006C00610064006F002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No pude vencerla ni una sola vez y eso\nhizo que fuera acumulando frustración.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Al final se me escapa decir cosas de mala\nmanera. Debo esforzarme para que no ocurra.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En ese caso te hará falta un entrenamiento\nintensivo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00200065007300650020006300610073006F002000740065002000680061007200E1002000660061006C0074006100200075006E00200065006E007400720065006E0061006D00690065006E0074006F000A0069006E00740065006E007300690076006F002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si combates contra mí y contra mi holograma\nal mismo tiempo, te volverás más fuerte en<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nun abrir y cerrar de ojos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 121
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He aquí un humilde presente para agradecer\ntu colaboración, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480065002000610071007500ED00200075006E002000680075006D0069006C00640065002000700072006500730065006E00740065002000700061007200610020006100670072006100640065006300650072000A0074007500200063006F006C00610062006F007200610063006900F3006E002C00200010000201000000002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Recibiste el Vestido de Lilette de color\nalternativo.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065006300690062006900730074006500200065006C0020005600650073007400690064006F0020006400650020004C0069006C006500740074006500200064006500200063006F006C006F0072000A0061006C007400650072006E0061007400690076006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te recomiendo combinarlo con mi peinado para\ntener el look completo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400650020007200650063006F006D00690065006E0064006F00200063006F006D00620069006E00610072006C006F00200063006F006E0020006D00690020007000650069006E00610064006F00200070006100720061000A00740065006E0065007200200065006C0020006C006F006F006B00200063006F006D0070006C00650074006F002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Luchar contra mi holograma me sirvió para\nconfirmar una vez más mi talento.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aunque sea un holograma, sigo siendo yo.\n¡Lilette no hay más que una!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410075006E007100750065002000730065006100200075006E00200068006F006C006F006700720061006D0061002C0020007300690067006F0020007300690065006E0064006F00200079006F002E000A00A1004C0069006C00650074007400650020006E006F00200068006100790020006D00E10073002000710075006500200075006E0061002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tengo que entrenar cuerpo y mente para que no\nse me vuelvan a escapar esas cosas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    }
  ],
